    "original": "I went there after being recommended by a local, and it was more delicious than I expected. The restaurant was big, and I liked beef much better than pork. It was always hard to eat because the meat was dry and dry when I ate elsewhere, but the moistness and tenderness were excellent. The sauce is delicious and the price is not cheap, but I'm satisfied."
